The rule reaches the predictions too:
\code{predict(model, newdata, type = "response")} is the probability of
\code{outcome_lv[2]}, the same class the coefficients describe. See
\code{\link[=predict.sa_model]{predict.sa_model()}}, and \code{\link[=coef.sa_fit]{coef.sa_fit()}} for the same word on the engine
